<title>Dashboard Data Entry Guide</title>
<style>
body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #333; line-height: 1.5; }
h1 { color: #1E3A8A; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px; }
h2 { color: #2563EB; font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 20px; }
